Package: FederatedPs
Title: Synthetic Propensity Score Checks with Cyclops Coordinate Descent
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Younwoo", "Ki", email = "dewonsunrise@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prepares fixed synthetic sparse propensity score inputs and compares
    local, pooled, and two-state coordinate descent in one R process. Reuses
    Cyclops calculation APIs and supplies the data structure used by CohortMethod
    matching and covariate balance. Simulation requires a separately patched
    Cyclops installation; no remote execution or database extraction is provided.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    Andromeda,
    CohortMethod (>= 6.0.3),
    Cyclops (>= 3.7.1),
    Matrix,
    methods,
    stats
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
